Usage:
  otel-collector-maple [flags]
  otel-collector-maple [command]

Available Commands:
  completion   Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  components   Outputs available components in this collector distribution
  featuregate  Display feature gates information
  help         Help about any command
  print-config Prints the Collector's configuration in the specified mode
  validate     Validates the config without running the collector

Flags:
      --config --config=file:/path/to/first --config=file:path/to/second   Locations to the config file(s), note that only a single location can be set per flag entry e.g. --config=file:/path/to/first --config=file:path/to/second. (default [])
      --feature-gates flag                                                 Comma-delimited list of feature gate identifiers. Prefix with '-' to disable the feature. '+' or no prefix will enable the feature. (default configoptional.AddEnabledField,-confmap.enableMergeAppendOption,confmap.newExpandedValueSanitizer,-connector.spanmetrics.excludeResourceMetrics,-connector.spanmetrics.includeCollectorInstanceID,-connector.spanmetrics.legacyMetricNames,-connector.spanmetrics.useSecondAsDefaultMetricsUnit,exporter.PersistRequestContext,-extension.healthcheck.useComponentStatus,-filter.filterlog.useOTTLBridge,-filter.filtermetric.useOTTLBridge,-filter.filterspan.useOTTLBridge,otelcol.printInitialConfig,ottl.PanicDuplicateName,ottl.contexts.enableOTelColContext,pdata.enableRefCounting,pdata.useCustomProtoEncoding,-pdata.useProtoPooling,-processor.filter.defaultErrorModeIgnore,-processor.transform.defaultErrorModeIgnore,-receiverhelper.newReceiverMetrics,-service.AllowNoPipelines,-service.profilesSupport,-spanmetrics.statusCodeConvention.useOtelPrefix,telemetry.UseLocalHostAsDefaultMetricsAddress,-telemetry.newPipelineTelemetry,-transform.flatten.logs)
  -h, --help                                                               help for otel-collector-maple
      --set value                                                          Set arbitrary component config property. The component has to be defined in the config file and the flag has a higher precedence. Array config properties are overridden and maps are joined. Example --set=processors.batch.timeout=2s

Use "otel-collector-maple [command] --help" for more information about a command.
